= V1 architecture-family migration =

The [[BITwiki:V1 page-role migration|page-role pass]] established that 83 of 162 archived V1 Main pages primarily describe BITwiki/BITCORE architecture rather than external subject knowledge.

This page performs the next decomposition:

<blockquote>'''Architecture source is a role. Architecture family identifies which design problem the source is evidence for.'''</blockquote>

The complete machine-readable map is generated by <code>scripts/classify_v1_architecture_families.py</code>. The mapping is explicit rather than fuzzy: the V1 archive is fixed evidence, and every assignment must remain directly reviewable.

